{'symbol': 'DGX', 'date': '2023-01-17 08:37:00', 'title': 'PACK HEALTH TO EXPAND IN BIRMINGHAM TO ACCELERATE GROWTH OF HEALTH COACHING SERVICES NATIONWIDE', 'text': "MARKS 1-YEAR SINCE QUEST DIAGNOSTICS ANNOUNCED PLANS TO ACQUIRE PACK HEALTH TO EXTEND DIGITAL ENGAGEMENT AND COACHING SERVICES TO HEALTH PLANS, EMPLOYERS AND LIFE SCIENCES COMPANIES BIRMINGHAM, ALA., JAN. 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEADING PATIENT ENGAGEMENT COMPANY PACK HEALTH, A QUEST DIAGNOSTICS (NYSE: DGX) COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO NEARLY DOUBLE THE SPACE OF ITS HEADQUARTER FACILITIES IN BIRMINGHAM AND ADD AT LEAST 200 FULL-TIME EMPLOYEE POSITIONS BASED ON ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT INCENTIVES FROM THE STATE OF ALABAMA IN RECOGNITION OF THE PUBLIC BENEFITS ACCRUING FROM THE EXPANSION OF PACK HEALTH'S LANDMARK BIRMINGHAM FACILITY."}